hadiths[251]{hadithnumber,text}:
"500","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo mujh par ek baar salat bheje, Allah us par das baar salat bhejta hai aur us se das khatayein mita deta hai."
"501","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par chadhe; jab pehli seedhi chadhe, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ameen."" Phir doosri chadhe, toh farmaya: ""Ameen."" Phir teesri chadhe: toh farmaya: ""Ameen."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum ne Aapko Ameen kehte hue suna teen baar?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab main pehli seedhi chadha, Jibreel (alaihis salam) mere paas aaye, phir kaha: Bad-bakht banda jis ne Ramadan paya phir us mein se nikla aur use bakhsha na gaya. Toh main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir kaha: Bad-bakht banda jis ne apne walidain ya un mein se ek ko paya phir woh donon use jannat mein dakhil na karein. Toh main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir kaha: Bad-bakht banda jis ke paas tumhara zikr hua aur us ne tum par salat na bheji. Toh main ne kaha: Ameen."
"502","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo mujh par ek baar salat bheje, Allah us par das baar salat bhejta hai."
"503","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mimbar par chadhe aur farmaya: ""Ameen, ameen, ameen."" Un se kaha gaya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Tum aisa nahin karte the?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jibreel ne mujh se kaha: Naak khaak-aalood ho us bande ki jis ne apne walidain ya un mein se ek ko paya lekin unhon ne use jannat mein dakhil na kiya. Main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: Naak khaak-aalood ho us bande ki jis par Ramadan dakhil hua use bakhsha na gaya. Toh main ne kaha: Ameen. Phir unhon ne kaha: Naak khaak-aalood ho us shakhs ki jis ke paas tumhara zikr hua phir us ne tum par salat na bheji, toh main ne kaha: Ameen."
"504","[AI-translation] Juwairiyah bint al-Haris bin Abi Dhirar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke paas se bahar nikle aur unka naam Barrah tha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne uska naam badla phir use Juwairiyah nam diya phir bahar nikle aur na-pasand kiya ke dakhil hon aur uska naam Barrah ho phir unke paas wapas aaye din chadhne ke baad, jab woh apni majlis mein theen phir farmaya: ""Tum ab tak apni majlis mein ho? Be-shak main ne tumhare baad chaar kalimat teen baar kahe; agar unhein tumhare kalimaton se taula jaye, toh woh un par ghalib aayein: Subhanallah wa bihamdih, adada khalqih, wa ridha nafsih, wa zinata Arshih, wa midada ya madada kalimatih [Allah paak hai aur uski hamd ke sath, uski makhlooq ki tadaad, uske nafs ki raza, uske Arsh ke wazan, aur uske kalimaton ki siyahi barabar]."
"505","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah se jahannum ki panah mango; Allah se qabr ke azab ki panah mango; Allah se Masih Dajjal ke fitne ki panah mango; Allah se zindagi aur maut ke fitne ki panah mango."
"506","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: ""Ae Allah! Mere liye meri samaat aur basarat durust kar, un donon ko mujh se waris bana, mujh par zulm karne wale par meri madad kar, aur mujh se us se badla dikha."
"507","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe meri samaat aur basarat se nafa de, un donon ko mujh se waris bana, mere dushman par meri madad kar, aur mujhe us se badla dikha."
"508","[AI-translation] Tariq bin Ashyam Ashjai se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum subah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jate the; ek mard aur aurat aate aur kehte: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main kya kahun jab namaz parhun? Aap farmate: Kaho: Allahummaghfirli, warhamni, wahdini, warzuqni [Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par reham kar, mujhe hidayat de, aur mujhe rizq de] be-shak us ne tumhari duniya aur aakhirat jama kar li."
"509","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas andar tashreef late the ahl-e-bait ek din Aap andar tashreef laye, phir hamare liye dua ki. Umm Sulaim ne kaha: ""Tumhara chhota khadim, kya tum uske liye dua nahin karoge?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Uska maal aur aulaad zyada kar, uski umr daraaz kar, aur use bakhsh de."" Aap ne mere liye teen dua ki: main ne ek sau teen [bachche] dafan kiye; mere phal saal mein do baar khate hain; meri umr daraaz hui yahan tak ke main logon se sharmaya, aur maghfirat ki umeed rakhta hun."
"510","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se ek ki dua qabool hoti hai jab tak [gunah ya qata-rehmi se dua na kare, ya] jald-baazi na kare: woh kehta hai: Main ne dua ki phir mere liye qabool nahin hui [phir dua chhod de]."
"511","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shuayb se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main susti aur qarz se teri panah mangta hun; main Masih Dajjal ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun; main aag ke azab se teri panah mangta hun."
"512","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se; aur Atthar bin Abi Maimunah se, Abu Rafe se, Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Allah se zindagi aur maut ke shar, qabr ke azab, aur Masih Dajjal ke shar ki panah mangte the."
"513","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah se nahin mangta, Allah us par ghadabnak hota hai."
"514","[AI-translation] Aban bin Usman se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo har subah aur har raat teen baar teen baar kahe: Bismillahilladhi la yadhurru maasmihi shai-un fil ardhi wa la fis sama, wa Huwas Samiul Alim [Allah ke naam se jiske naam ke sath zameen aur aasman mein koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti; woh Sunne wala Janne wala hai], use koi cheez nuqsan nahin degi."" Use juzwi falij laga tha, shakhs use dekhne laga; woh samajh gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Hadees waisi hi hai jaise main ne tumhein batayi; lekin main ne use us din nahin kaha; taake Allah ka faisla nafiz ho."
"515","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Do waqt jin mein aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain, aur dua karne wala kam hi hota hai jiski dua radd ho: jab azaan hazir ho, aur Allah ke raaste mein saf."
"516","[AI-translation] Shakal bin Humaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe dua sikhao jis se main nafa uthaun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kaho: Allahumma afini min sharri sami, wa basari, wa lisani, wa qalbi, wa sharri maniyyi [Ae Allah! Mujhe meri samaat, basarat, zabaan, dil, aur mani ke shar se aafiyat de]."" Waki ne kaha: ""Maniyyi"" yani: zina aur fujoor."
"517","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne [doosri riwayat mein: Nabi] (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is se dua karte hue suna: ""Ae Rabb [doosri riwayat mein: Ae Allah], meri madad kar, mujh par madad na kar; mujhe ghalib kar, mujh par ghalib na kar; mere liye tadbeer kar, mujh par tadbeer na kar; mere liye hidayat aasan kar [doosri mein: mujhe hidayat aasan kar]; mujh par zulm karne wale par meri madad kar. Ae Rabb! Mujhe apna bahut shukr karne wala bana, bahut zikr karne wala, darne wala, farmabardar, aajzi karne wala, aah karne wala wapas aane wala meri tauba qabool kar aur mera gunah dho de aur meri dua qabool kar, aur meri hujjat pukhta kar, aur mere dil ko hidayat de, aur meri zabaan seedhi kar, aur mere dil ka keena nikal de."
"518","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Kaab Qurazi se riwayat hai: Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan ne mimbar par kaha: ""Be-shak jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, jo Allah roke use koi dene wala nahin, aur maal-dar ko Us se uska maal nafa nahin deta. Jise Allah khair chahe, use deen mein samajh deta hai."" Main ne yeh kalimat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sune, in lakdiyon [mimbar] par."
"519","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte: ""Ae Allah! Mere liye mera deen durust kar jo mere muamle ka muhafiz hai; mere liye meri duniya durust kar jis mein meri maeeshat hai; maut ko mere liye har shar se rehmat bana."" Ya jaise Aap ne kaha."
"520","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aazmaish ki sakhti, bad-bakhti ke gherne, bure faisle, aur dushman ki [museebat par] khushi se panah mangte the."" Sufyan ne kaha: Hadees mein teen hain, main ne ek izafa ki; main nahin jaanta kaun si."
"521","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main kamzori, susti, buzdili, budhape se teri panah mangta hun; main zindagi aur maut ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun; main qabr ke azab se teri panah mangta hun."
"522","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main fikr aur ghum, aajzi aur susti, buzdili aur bukhl, qarz ke bojh, aur mardon ke ghalbe se teri panah mangta hun."
"523","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki dua mein se tha: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de jo main ne aage bheja aur jo peeche chhoda, jo main ne chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada jaanta hai; be-shak Tu Aage karne wala aur Peeche karne wala hai; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin."
"524","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua karte: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se hidayat, paak-damani, aur ghina mangta hun."" Hamare sahaba ne Amr se riwayat kiya: ""aur taqwa."
"525","[AI-translation] Sumamah bin Hazn se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek budhe ko buland aawaz se pukarte hue suna: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main us shar se teri panah mangta hun jise kuchh nahin milata."" Main ne poocha: Yeh budha kaun hai? Kaha gaya: ""Abu Darda."
"526","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is dua se bahut dua karte the: ""Ae Allah, hamein duniya mein hasana de, aur aakhirat mein hasana, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha."" Unhon ne kaha: Shubah ne kaha: Main ne use Qatadah se zikr kiya; unhon ne kaha: Anas use dua karte the, lekin use marfu nahin karte the."
"527","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main faqr aur zillat se teri panah mangta hun; main teri panah mangta hun ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm ho."
"528","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kasrat se kehte: ""Ae Allah! Ae dilon ke Pherne wale, hamare dilon ko apne deen par sabit rakh."
"529","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ke Aap dua karte: ""Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd aasmanon bhar aur zameen bhar, aur uske baad jo Tu chahe us cheez bhar, Ae Allah mujhe oos aur barf aur thande pani se paak kar, Ae Allah mujhe gunahon se paak kar aur mujhe saaf kar jaise safaid kapda mail se saaf kiya jata hai."
"530","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki dua mein se tha: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main teri nemat ke zawal, teri aafiyat ke tabdeel, tere achanak azab, aur tere sare ghadab se teri panah mangta hun."
"531","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aasman ke ufuq mein se kisi ufuq mein badal dekhte, Aap apna kaam chhod dete agarche namaz [sunnat] mein hote phir uski taraf mutawajjuh hote; agar Allah use hata deta, Aap Allah ki hamd karte; agar barish hoti, Aap farmate: ""Allahumma shayyiban nafian [Ae Allah! Barasne wali nafa-bakhsh barish]."
"532","[AI-translation] Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Khabbab ke paas aaya use saat baar dagha gaya tha unhon ne kaha: ""Agar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua se mana na kiya hota, toh main us se dua karta."
"533","[AI-translation] Abu Musa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ke Aap is dua se dua karte the: ""Ae Rabb [doosre lafz mein: Ae Allah], mere sare khata, mere muamle mein meri tamam zyadti, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada jaanta hai muaf kar, Ae Allah. Mere sare khata, mere qasd, meri jahalat aur mazaq muaf kar aur sab mujh mein hain. Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de jo main ne aage bheja aur jo peeche chhoda, jo main ne chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya; Tu Aage karne wala hai aur Tu Peeche karne wala hai; Tu har cheez par qadir hai."
"534","[AI-translation] Muadh bin Jabal se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda aur farmaya: ""Ae Muadh!"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Labbaik."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main tumhein mehbub rakhta hun."" Main ne jawab diya: ""Aur main Allah ki qasam tumhein mehbub rakhta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein kalimat na sikhaun jo tum har namaz ke baad kaho?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kaho: Allahumma ainni ala dhikrika wa shukrika, wa husni ibadatik [Ae Allah! Mujhe apne zikr, apne shukr, aur apni ibadat khub ada karne par madad kar]."
"535","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas kaha: ""Alhamdulillah hamdan kaseeran tayyiban mubarakan fih [Sab tareef Allah ke liye, kasrat wali hamd, paakiza, barkat wali]."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Us kalime ka malik kaun hai?"" Woh khamosh raha, aur samjha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us par kisi cheez ka hamla kiya jise woh na-pasand karta tha. Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh kaun hai? Us ne siwa sach ke kuchh nahin kaha."" Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Main; main us se khair ki umeed rakhta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main ne terah farishton ko dekha daudte hue kaun use Allah Azza wa Jalla ki taraf uthaye."
"536","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khala mein dakhil hone ka irada karte, Aap farmate: ""Allahumma inni auzu bika minal khubusi wal khaba-is [Ae Allah! Be-shak main mard aur aurat shaitanon se teri panah mangta hun]."
"537","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khala se bahar nikalte, Aap farmate: ""Ghufranak [Teri bakhshish]."
"538","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein yeh dua sikhate the jaise hamein Quran ki surah sikhate: ""Main Tujh se jahannum ke azab ki panah mangta hun; main Tujh se qabr ke azab ki panah mangta hun; main Tujh se Masih Dajjal ke fitne ki panah mangta hun; main Tujh se zindagi aur maut ke fitne ki panah mangta hun; main Tujh se qabr ke fitne ki panah mangta hun."
"539","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main [khala] Maimunah ke paas raat guzari; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) uthe apni hajat ko gaye, apne chehre aur hathon ko dhoya, phir soye. Phir uthe, mashkize ke paas aaye, uska bandhan khola, phir wuzu kiya do wuzuon ke darmiyan wuzu zyada nahin kiya aur mukammal kiya, phir namaz parhi. Main utha aur susti ki, na-pasand karte hue ke woh dekhe ke main use dekh raha tha; main ne wuzu kiya. Aap namaz parhne khade hue; main Aapke bayein khada hua; Aap ne mera kaan pakda aur mujhe apne dayein ghumaya. Aapki [raat ki] namaz terah rakat poori hui. Phir let gaye aur soye yahan tak ke kharrate liye aur jab sote kharrate lete Bilal ne Aapko namaz ki khabar di, Aap ne namaz parhi aur wuzu nahin kiya. Aapki dua mein tha: ""Ae Allah! Mere dil mein noor kar, meri samaat mein noor, mere dayein noor, mere bayein noor, mere oopar noor, mere neeche noor, mere aage noor, mere peeche noor; mera noor azeem kar."" Kuraib ne kaha: Saat [duayein] sandooq mein main Abbas ki aulaad mein se ek shakhs se mila, us ne mujhe un se bayan kiya; us ne zikr kiya: mere asab, mera gosht, mera khoon, mere baal, meri khaal aur do sifatein zikr kein."
"540","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat hai: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ke darmiyan namaz ke liye khade hote, Aap farmate: ""Ae Allah! Tere liye hamd; Tu aasman, zameen, aur un mein jo hai unka noor hai; Tere liye hamd; Tu aasman aur zameen ka qayam karne wala hai; Tere liye hamd; Tu aasman, zameen, aur un mein jo hai unka Rabb hai. Tu al-Haqq hai; Tera wada sachcha; Tujh se mulaqat sachchi; jannat sachchi; aag sachchi; qiyamat sachchi. Ae Allah! Main ne Tere supurd kiya; Tujh par iman laya; Tujh par tawakkul kiya; Teri taraf wapas aaya; Tere sath behas ki; Teri taraf faisla le gaya. Mere aage aur peeche, chhupe aur zahir gunah bakhsh de; Tu mera mabood hai; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin."
"541","[AI-translation] Rifaa Zuraqi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din jab mushrikeen peeche hate, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Seedhe raho yahan tak ke main apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ki sana karun."" Woh Aapke peeche safein bana kar khade hue aur farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Tere liye sari hamd; Ae Allah! Jo Tu phailaye use koi rokne wala nahin, jo Tu door kare use koi qareeb karne wala nahin, jo Tu qareeb kare use koi door karne wala nahin, jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, jo Tu roke use koi dene wala nahin. Ae Allah! Hum par apni barkat, rehmat, fazl, aur rizq phaila. Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se qayam rehne wali nemat mangta hun, jo badalti nahin aur khatam nahin hoti. Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se tangi ke din nemat mangta hun, jang ke din aman. Ae Allah! Main Tujh se us shar se panah mangta hun jo Tu ne hamein diya aur us shar se jo Tu ne hum se roka. Ae Allah! Iman ko hum mein mehbub bana aur use hamare dilon mein muzayyan kar; kufr, fisq, aur nafarmani ko hum mein na-pasandida bana; hamein seedhe logon mein se bana. Ae Allah! Hamein musalman hote hue wafat de, musalman hote hue zinda rakh, saliheen se mila baghair zillat, aur baghair fitne. Ae Allah! Kafiron se lad jo Tere raaste se rokte hain aur Tere Rasoolon ko jhutlate hain; un par apna azab aur azaab kar. Ae Allah! Kafiron se lad jinhein Kitab di gayi, ae Haq mabood."
"542","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakrah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne walid se kaha: ""Ae mere abba! Main tumhein har subah dua karte sunta hun: Allahumma afini fi badani, Allahumma afini fi sami, Allahumma afini fi basari, la ilaha illa Anta [Ae Allah! Mere badan mein aafiyat de, meri samaat mein aafiyat de, meri basarat mein aafiyat de; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin] tum use teen baar shaam ko, aur subah teen baar dohrate ho aur kehte ho: Allahumma inni auzu bika minal kufri wal faqri, Allahumma inni auzu bika min adhabil qabri, la ilaha illa Anta [Ae Allah! Be-shak main kufr aur faqr se teri panah mangta hun; main qabr ke azab se teri panah mangta hun; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin] tum use teen baar shaam ko aur subah teen baar dohrate ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan, ae mere bete! Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un se kehte hue suna; main uski sunnat par chalna chahta hun."" Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tang-dast ki duayein: Allahumma rahmataka arju, wa la takilni ila nafsi tarfata ain, wa aslih li shaani kullah, la ilaha illa Anta [Ae Allah! Main Teri rehmat ki umeed rakhta hun; mujhe meri zaat ke hawale palak jhapakne tak na kar; mere sare muamle durust kar; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin]."
"543","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tangi ke waqt [doosre tareeq mein: dua karte] kehte the: ""Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin Azeem Haleem; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin Arsh Azeem ka Rabb; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aasmanon ka Rabb, zameen ka Rabb, aur Arsh Kareem ka Rabb [doosre tareeq mein: Azeem]. Ae Allah! Uska shar pher de."
"544","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein muamlon mein istikhara sikhate the jaise Quran ki surah: ""Jab [tum mein se koi] muamle ka irada kare, toh use do rakat parhni chahiye, phir kahe: Allahumma inni astakhiruka biilmika, wastaqdiruka biqudratika, wa as-aluka min fadhlika al-azim; fa innaka taqdiru wa la aqdiru, wa taalamu wa la aalamu, wa Anta allamul ghuyub. Allahumma in kunta taalamu hadhal amra khairan li fi dini, wa maashi, wa aqibati amri ya Aap ne farmaya: fi ajili amri wa ajilihi faqdirhu li; wa in kunta taalamu anna hadhal amra sharrun li fi dini wa maashi wa aqibati ya Aap ne farmaya: ajili amri wa ajilihi, fasrifhu anni wasrifni anhu, waqdir liyal khaira haisu kana, summa radhdhini [Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tere ilm se Tujh se khair mangta hun, Teri qudrat se Tujh se qadar mangta hun, aur Tere azeem fazl se mangta hun; be-shak Tu qadir hai jabke main qadir nahin; Tu jaanta hai jabke main nahin jaanta; Tu ghaib janne wala hai. Ae Allah! Agar Tu jaanta hai yeh muamla mere liye mere deen, meri maeeshat, aur mere muamle ke anjaam mein khair hai ya Aap ne farmaya: mere muamle ki jald aur der mein toh use mere liye muqaddar kar; agar Tu jaanta hai yeh muamla mere liye mere deen, meri maeeshat, aur mere muamle ke anjaam mein shar hai ya Aap ne farmaya: meri jald muamle aur der mein, toh use mujh se pher de aur mujhe us se pher de; mere liye khair muqaddar kar jahan ho, phir mujhe us par raazi kar] aur woh apni hajat ka naam le."
"545","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is masjid mein Masjid al-Fath mein Peer, Mangal, aur Budh ko dua ki; Budh ke din do namazon ke darmiyan Aapke liye qabool hui."" Jabir ne kaha: Mujh par koi ahem sakht muamla nazil na hua magar main ne us ghadi ko chuna; main ne us mein Allah se Budh ke din do namazon ke darmiyan us ghadi mein dua ki, magar main ne qabooliyat jaani."
"546","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha; ek shakhs ne dua ki: ""Ae aasmanon ke Badee, ae Zinda, ae Qayam! Be-shak main Tujh se mangta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho us ne kis se dua ki? Qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, us ne Allah se Uske naam se dua ki jab us se manga jaye, Woh qabool karta hai."
"547","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: ""Mujhe dua sikhao jo main apni namaz mein kahun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kaho: Allahumma inni zalamtu nafsi zulman kaseeran, wa la yaghfirudh dhunuba illa Anta, faghfirli min indika maghfiratan, innaka Antal Ghafurur Rahim [Ae Allah! Be-shak main ne apne nafs par bahut zulm kiya; gunah Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta; mujhe apne paas se bakhshish de; be-shak Tu Bakshne wala Raheem hai]."
"548","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masud se riwayat hai: Jab tum mein se kisi ka imam ho jiski sakhti ya zulm se woh dare, toh use kehna chahiye: ""Ae Allah, saat aasmanon ke Rabb aur Arsh Azeem ke Rabb! Mere liye falan bin falan aur uske girohon se jo Teri makhlooq mein se hain panah ban; ke un mein se koi mujh par zyadti kare, ya had se badhe. Teri panah azeez hai, Teri sana buland hai; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin."
"549","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum khauf-naak hukmaran ke paas jao aur tum daro ke woh tum par hamla kare, kaho: ""Allahu Akbar. Allah apni sari makhlooq se azeez tar hai; Allah us se azeez tar hai jis se main darta aur khauf karta hun. Main Allah ki panah mangta hun jiske siwa koi mabood nahin, saat aasmanon ko thamne wale ke woh zameen par girein magar Uske izn se; Tere falan bande, uski faujon, uske pairukaron, aur uske girohon ke shar se jinn aur insan mein se. Ae Allah! Unke shar se mere liye panah ban; Teri sana buland hai, Teri panah azeez hai, Tera naam babarkat hai; Tere siwa koi mabood nahin"" teen baar."
"550","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Koi musalman dua nahin karta baghair gunah aur baghair qata-rehmi magar Woh use teen mein se ek deta hai: ya uski dua uske liye jald kare, ya use uske liye aakhirat mein zakheera kare, ya us se us jaisa shar hata de."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Phir hum kasrat karenge!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah zyada hai."
"551","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi momin Allah ki taraf apna chehra nahin karta, us se sawal mangta hai, magar Woh use deta hai: use duniya mein jald deta hai, ya use uske liye aakhirat mein zakheera karta hai jab tak woh jald-baazi na kare."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Uski jald-baazi kya hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh kehta hai: Main ne dua ki aur dua ki, lekin main use mere liye qabool hota nahin dekhta."
"552","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ke paas dua se zyada izzat wali koi cheez nahin."
"553","[AI-translation] Noman bin Bashir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak dua ibadat hai."" Phir Aap ne parha: {Mujh se dua karo, main tumhare liye qabool karunga} [Ghafir: 60]."
"554","[AI-translation] Maqil bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gaya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Bakr! Tum mein shirk cheenti ke chalne se zyada chhupa hua hai."" Abu Bakr ne kaha: ""Kya shirk siwa iske hai ke Allah ke sath doosra mabood banaye?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, shirk cheenti ke chalne se zyada chhupa hua hai. Kya main tumhein koi cheez na bataun jab tum use kaho, tum se uska thoda aur zyada door ho jaye?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kaho: Allahumma inni auzu bika an ushrika bika wa ana aalamu, wa astaghfiruka lima la aalamu [Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se panah mangta hun ke main Tere sath shirk karun jabke main jaanta hun; main Tujh se uski bakhshish mangta hun jo nahin jaanta]."
"555","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tez hawa chalti, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se us khair ka sawal karta hun jo uske sath bheji gayi; main Tujh se us shar ki panah mangta hun jo uske sath bheja gaya."
"556","[AI-translation] Salamah [yani Ibn al-Akwa] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hawa tez hoti, woh kehte: ""Ae Allah! [Bana] phal dene wali, baanjh nahin."
"557","[AI-translation] Ubayy se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hawa ko bura na kaho; jab tum us mein se woh dekho jo tum na-pasand karte ho, toh kaho: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak hum Tujh se is hawa ki khair, us mein jo khair, aur jo uske sath bheji gayi mangte hain; hum Tujh se is hawa ke shar, us mein jo shar, aur jo uske sath bheja gaya panah mangte hain."
"558","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Hawa Allah ki rehmat mein se hai: rehmat aur azab samet aati hai; use bura na kaho. Allah se uski khair mango aur Allah se uske shar ki panah mango."
"559","[AI-translation] Musa bin Abd al-Aziz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hakam ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrimah ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Ibn Abbas jab garaj ki aawaz sunte, kehte: ""Paak hai woh zaat jiski garaj tasbeeh karti hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak garaj farishta hai jo baarish ko hankata hai jaise charwaha apni bakriyon ko hankata hai."
"560","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke jab woh garaj sunte, woh baat chhod dete aur kehte: ""Paak hai woh zaat jiski {garaj uski hamd samet tasbeeh karti hai, aur farishte uske khauf se}"" [Raad: 13]; phir kehte: ""Be-shak yeh zameen walon ke liye sakht waeed hai."
"561","[AI-translation] Ausat bin Ismail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad kehte hue suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pehle saal mere is maqam par khade hue Abu Bakr ro pade phir kaha: ""Tum par sach lazim hai; be-shak woh neki ke sath hai, donon jannat mein hain. Aur jhoot se bacho, be-shak woh fujoor ke sath hai, donon aag mein hain. Aur Allah se aafiyat mango. Be-shak yaqeen ke baad aafiyat se bahtar kuchh nahin diya gaya. Aur qata na karo, peeth na phero, hasad na karo, bughz na rakho, Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano."
"562","[AI-translation] Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib se riwayat hai, main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe kuchh sikhao jo main Allah se mangu."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abbas! Allah se aafiyat mango,"" phir teen [din] thehre, phir main aaya aur kaha: Mujhe kuchh sikhao jo main Allah se mangu, Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abbas, ae Rasoolullah ke chacha! Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat mango."
"563","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas kaha: ""Ae Allah! Agar Tu ne mujhe maal nahin diya jo main sadqa karun, toh mujhe aazmaish se aazma jis mein ajr ho."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Subhanallah! Tum uski taqat nahin rakhte! Tum ne kyun na kaha: Allahumma atina fid dunya hasanah, wa fil akhirati hasanah, wa qina adhaban nar [Ae Allah! Hamein duniya mein hasana de, aakhirat mein hasana, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha]?"
"564","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Shakhs kehta hai: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main aazmaish ki sakhti se teri panah mangta hun."" Phir khamosh hota hai, phir jab woh kahe toh use kehna chahiye: ""Siwa aazmaish ke jis mein bulandi [darja] ho."
"565","[AI-translation] Abu Naufal bin Abi Aqrab se riwayat hai ke unke walid ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se roze ke bare mein poocha? Aap ne farmaya: ""Har mahine ek din roza rakho."" Main ne kaha: Mere maa-baap aap par qurban, mujhe zyada dein. Aap ne farmaya: ""Zyada do, zyada do! Har mahine do din roza rakho."" Main ne kaha: Mere maa-baap aap par qurban, mujhe zyada dein; main apne nafs ko qawi pata hun. Aap ne farmaya: ""Main apne nafs ko qawi pata hun, main apne nafs ko qawi pata hun!"" Woh khamosh hue yahan tak ke main ne samjha woh mujhe nahin badhayenge, phir farmaya: ""Har mahine teen [din] roza rakho."
"566","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the tez badbu-daar hawa uthi Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho yeh kya hai? Yeh unki hawa hai jo momineen ki ghibat karte hain"" [doosri riwayat mein: ""Be-shak munafiqeen mein se logon ne musalmanon mein se logon ki ghibat ki, toh yeh hawa uske liye bheji gayi""]."
"567","[AI-translation] Ibn Umm Abd [Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jiski paas momin ki ghibat ki jaye phir woh uska difa kare, Allah use duniya aur aakhirat mein khair se jaza dega; jiski paas momin ki ghibat ki jaye phir woh uska difa na kare, Allah use us se duniya aur aakhirat mein shar se jaza dega. Kisi ne ghibat karne wale momin se bura luqma nahin nigla; agar woh us mein woh kahe jo woh jaanta hai, us ne uski ghibat ki, aur agar woh us mein woh kahe jo woh nahin jaanta, us ne us par buhtan bandha."
"568","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the; Aap do qabron par guzre jinke malik azab diye ja rahe the. Aap ne farmaya: ""Donon bade mein azab nahin diye jate; lekin: un mein se ek logon ki ghibat karta tha; doosra peshab se paaki nahin karta tha."" Aap ne geeli tehni mangi ya do tehniyan, unhein toda, phir har tukde ka hukm diya toh qabr par gadh diya gaya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak un donon ke azab mein se halka hoga, jab tak donon geeli hon ya: khushk na hon."
"569","[AI-translation] Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-Aas apne chand sahaba ke sath chal rahe the; woh phoolay hue mare hue khachchar par guzre. Unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se ek ka [murdar] mein se yahan tak khana ke uska pait bhar jaye, us se bahtar hai ke woh musalman ka gosht khaye."
"570","[AI-translation] Ubadah bin al-Walid bin as-Samit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath nikla jab jawan ladka tha; hum ek budhe se mile [burdah aur muafiri kapda pehne, uske ghulam burdah aur muafiri kapda pehne]. Main ne kaha: ""Ae chacha, tumhein kis ne roka ke tum apne ghulam ko yeh namirah do aur burdah lo, toh tum par do burdah hon, aur us par namirah?"" Woh mere walid ki taraf mutawajjuh hue, aur kaha: Kya yeh tumhara beta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne mera sir sehlaya aur kaha: Allah tum mein barkat de, main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Unhein khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhein pehnao jo tum pehente ho. Ae mere bhatije, duniya ke saman ka jana mujhe us se zyada mehbub hai ke woh aakhirat ke saman mein se le. Main ne kaha: Ae mere abba! Yeh shakhs kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Yusr [Kaab] bin Amr."
"571","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ziyad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne salaf ko paya: woh ek ghar mein apne ghar walon samet hote the; kabhi un mein se baaz par mehmaan utarta, aur un mein se ek ki handi aag par hoti, phir mehmaan wala apne mehmaan ke liye use le leta; handi wala use kho deta. Phir kehta: Handi kis ne li? Mehmaan wala kehta: Hum ne use apne mehmaan ke liye li. Handi wala kehta: ""Allah tumhein us mein barkat de"" [ya us jaisa kalima]. Baqiyyah ne kaha: Muhammad ne kaha: Roti jab woh pakate waisa hi tha; unke darmiyan sirf sar-kande ki deewarein theen. Baqiyyah ne kaha: Main ne bhi woh paya: Muhammad bin Ziyad aur uske sahaba."
"572","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; Aap ne apni biwiyon ke paas bheja; unhon ne kaha: ""Hamare paas pani ke siwa kuchh nahin."" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kaun is ko apne sath milayega ya mehmaan banayega?"" Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Main."" Woh use apni biwi ke paas le gaya aur kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke mehmaan ki izzat karo."" Uski biwi ne kaha: ""Hamare paas bachchon ke khane ke siwa kuchh nahin."" Us ne kaha: ""Apna khana tayyar karo, apna chiraagh durust karo, apne bachchon ko sula do jab woh raat ka khana chahein."" Uski biwi ne apna khana tayyar kiya, apna chiraagh durust kiya, apne bachchon ko sulaya; phir khadi hui goya apna chiraagh durust karti ho phir use bujha diya; donon dikhane lage goya woh kha rahe hain, aur bhooke soye. Subah woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gaya; Aap [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah hansa ya: tajjub kiya tum donon ke fail par?"" Allah ne nazil kiya: {""Aur woh apne nafs par tarjeeh dete hain agarche unhein hajat ho aur jo apne nafs ke bukhl se bachaya gaya toh wahi kamyab hain""} [Hashr: 9]."
"573","[AI-translation] Abu Shuraih Adawi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere donon kaanon ne suna aur meri donon aankhon ne dekha jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke apne padosi ki izzat kare; jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke apne mehmaan ki uske tohfe samet izzat kare."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Uska tohfa kya hai, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ek din aur raat; mehmaani teen din hai; jo uske siwa ho toh woh us par sadqa hai. [Uske liye halal nahin ke woh uske paas thehre yahan tak ke use tang kare.] Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, use chahiye ke khair kahe ya khamosh rahe."
"574","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mehmaani teen din hai; jo uske baad ho toh woh sadqa hai."
"575","[AI-translation] Miqdam Abu Karimah Shami se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mehmaan ki raat har musalman par wajib haq hai; jo subah uske sehan mein [baghair mehmaani mehmaan samet] ho, woh us par qarz hai agar chahe; agar chahe use taqaza kare, agar chahe use chhode."
"576","[AI-translation] Uqbah bin Amir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Tum hamein bhejte ho, hum kisi qaum par utarte hain lekin woh hamari mehmaani nahin karte; is bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai?"" Aap ne hum se farmaya: ""Jab tum kisi qaum par utro, woh tumhare liye woh hukm karein jo mehmaan ke liye munasib ho toh qabool karo; agar woh na karein toh un se mehmaan ka haq lo jo unke liye munasib ho."
"577","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad se riwayat hai: ""Ke Abu Usaid Saidi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne nikah mein dawat di; unki biwi us din unki khidmat karti thi aur woh dulhan thi. Unhon ne kaha [ya unhon ne kaha]: Kya tum jaante ho main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye kya bhigoya? Main ne Aapke liye raat bhar khajoorein bartan mein bhigoyin."
"578","[AI-translation] Nuaim bin Qaanab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Dharr ke paas aaya lekin unhein na paya. Main ne unki biwi se kaha: ""Abu Dharr kahan hain?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh kaam karte hain; woh abhi tumhare paas aayenge."" Main unke liye baitha; woh do oonton samet aaye ek ko doosre ke peeche joda gaya tha dono mein se har ek ki gardan mein mashkiza tha, unhon ne unhein rakha, phir aaye. Main ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Dharr! Koi shakhs nahin jise main milta tha woh mujhe milne mein tum se zyada mehbub tha, aur mujhe milne mein tum se zyada na-pasandida tha!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhare baap ke liye; isko kis ne jama kiya?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne jahiliyat mein zinda dafan ki thi; mujhe dar hai ke tum se milun phir tum kaho: Tumhare liye tauba nahin, tumhare liye raasta nahin; main umeed rakhta tha ke tum kaho: Tumhare liye tauba aur raasta hai."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Kya tum ne jahiliyat mein kiya?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ne guzishta muaf kiya."" Unhon ne apni biwi se kaha: ""Khana lao."" Uski biwi ne inkar kiya, phir us ne use hukm diya phir us ne inkar kiya, yahan tak ke donon ki aawazein buland huin. Unhon ne kaha: ""Wah, be-shak tum woh nahin kartin jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha."" Main ne poocha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unke bare mein kya kaha?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Be-shak aurat [pasli se] paida hui; agar tum use seedha karna chaho, tum use tod doge; agar tum use mudarat karo, toh us mein tedhapan aur kifayat [nafa] hai."" Uski biwi gayi aur qataa parinde jaisi sareed lekar aayi; unhon ne kaha: ""Khao, main tumhein nahin daraunga; main rozedar hun."" Phir woh namaz ke liye khade hue, ruku jald kiya, phir phire aur khaya. Main ne kaha: ""Inna lillah! Mujhe dar tha ke tum mujhe jhutlaoge!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhare baap ke liye, main ne tum se milne ke baad jhoot nahin bola."" Main ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne mujhe nahin bataya ke tum rozedar ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan; main ne is mahine teen din roza rakha, mere liye uska ajr likha gaya, aur khana mere liye halal hua."
"579","[AI-translation] Sauban se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak shakhs ke kharch kiye deenaron mein se afzal: deenar jo us ne apne ehl-o-ayal par kharch kiya, deenar jo us ne Allah ke raaste mein apne sahaba par kharch kiya, aur deenar jo us ne Allah ke raaste mein apni sawari par kharch kiya."" Abu Qilabah ne kaha: Us ne ehl-o-ayal se shuru kiya; kaun sa mard ajr mein us mard se bada hai jo chhote ehl-o-ayal par kharch kare yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jalla unhein ghani kare?"
"580","[AI-translation] Abu Masud Badri se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo apne ghar walon par kharch kare aur woh us par ajr ki umeed rakhe; woh uske liye sadqa tha."
"581","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mere paas ek deenar hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne nafs par kharch karo."" Us ne kaha: ""Mere paas doosra hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne khadim par kharch karo"" ya Aap ne farmaya: ""apne bete par."" Us ne kaha: ""Mere paas doosra hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Use Allah ke raaste mein rakho; woh sab se kamtar hai."
"582","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Chaar deenar: deenar jo tum ne miskeen ko diya, aur deenar jo tum ne gardan [aazadi] mein diya, aur deenar jo tum ne Allah ke raaste mein kharch kiya, aur deenar jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kiya un mein afzal woh hai jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kiya."
"583","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqas se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Saad se farmaya: ""Be-shak tum koi kharch kharch nahin karoge jis se tum Allah Azza wa Jalla ka chehra chahte ho, magar tumhein us se jaza di jayegi, hatta ke jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein rakhte ho."
"584","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Hamara Rabb Tabaraka wa Taala har raat duniya ke aasman ki taraf utarta hai, jab aakhri tihaayi raat baqi ho, phir farmata hai: Kaun Mujh se dua karta hai toh main uske liye qabool karun? Kaun Mujh se mangta hai toh main use dun? Kaun Mujh se bakhshish mangta hai toh main use bakhsh dun?"
"585","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Saudah ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jamu ki raat [Muzdalifah] ijazat mangi aur woh bhaari sust aurat theen Aap ne unhein ijazat di."
"586","[AI-translation] Ibn Masud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hunain ke maal-e-ghaneemat ko Jiranah mein taqseem kar rahe the, woh Aap par toot pade. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ka ek banda jise Allah ne qaum ki taraf bheja; unhon ne use jhutlaya aur zakhmi kiya; woh apni peshani se khoon ponchhta tha, aur kehta tha: Ae Allah meri qaum ko bakhsh de; be-shak woh nahin jaante."" Abdullah bin Masud ne kaha: ""Goya main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun woh shakhs ki hikayat karte hain jo apni peshani se [khoon] ponchhta hai."
"587","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum kisi ko kehte suno: Log halak hue, toh woh un mein sab se zyada halak hua."
"588","[AI-translation] Buraidah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Munafiq ko: sayyid na kaho; be-shak agar woh tumhara sayyid hua, tum ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ko naraz kiya."
"589","[AI-translation] Adi bin Artah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se kisi ki tareef ki jati, woh kehte: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe unke kehne par na pakad; mujhe bakhsh de jo woh nahin jaante."
"590","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai ke Abu Abdullah ne Abu Masud se kaha ya Abu Masud ne Abu Abdullah se kaha: ""Tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zaama [kehte hain] ke bare mein kya suna?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Shakhs ki badtareen sawari."
"591","[AI-translation] Abu Masud ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: ""Momin par lanat uske qatl jaisi hai."
"592","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ""Tum mein se koi us cheez ke bare mein na kahe jo woh nahin jaanta: Allah use jaanta hai; jabke Allah uske siwa jaanta hai woh Allah ke bare mein woh jaanta hai jo nahin janta; woh Allah ke paas azeem hai."
"593","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai: Ibn al-Kawwa ne Ali se kahkashan ke bare mein poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh aasman ka shagaaf hai; us se aasman musladhaar pani se khola gaya."
"594","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ""Qaus-e-quzah zameen walon ke liye gharq se aman hai; kahkashan aasman ka darwaza hai jis se woh phatta hai."
"595","[AI-translation] Abu al-Haris Kirmani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek shakhs ko Abu Raja se kehte hue suna: ""Tum par salam parhta hun, aur Allah se sawal karta hun ke woh mere aur tumhare darmiyan apni mustaqar rehmat mein jama kare!"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kya koi iski taqat rakhta hai?"" Unhon ne poocha: ""Uski mustaqar rehmat kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Jannat."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum ne durust nahin kaha."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Uski mustaqar rehmat kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne kaha: ""Rabbul Aalameen."
"596","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Haaye zamane ki museebat! Be-shak Allah Ad-Dahr [zamane ka Malik] hai"" [doosri riwayat mein: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: ""Main Ad-Dahr hun; Main raat aur din bhejta hun; jab Chahun, unhein rok lun. Aur angoor ko: al-karm na kaho; be-shak al-karm musalman mard hai""]."
"597","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko qurbani ka oont hankate dekha. Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Yeh qurbani ka oont hai!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Yeh qurbani ka oont hai!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Yeh qurbani ka oont hai!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho, tum par afsos."
"598","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Rifaa Qurazi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko suna aur ek shakhs un se pooch raha tha phir unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne roti aur gosht khaya [kya main wuzu karun]?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Tum par afsos, kya tum tayyibat se wuzu karte ho?"
"599","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hunain ke din Jiranah mein, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sath Bilal ki god mein sona tha, woh use taqseem kar rahe the; ek shakhs Aapke paas aaya aur bola: Adl karo; be-shak tum adl nahin karte! Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par afsos, kaun adl karega agar main adl na karun?!"" Umar ne kaha: Mujhe chhodo Ya Rasoolullah main is munafiq ki gardan uda dun. Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak iske sathi hain ya: uske sathiyon mein se jo Quran parhte hain, unke halaq se nahin guzarta, woh deen se nikal jate hain jaise teer shikar se nikal jata hai."" Main ne Sufyan se kaha: ""Kya Qarrah ne use Amr se Jabir se riwayat kiya?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main use Amr se yaad nahin karta. Us ne hamein Abu Zubair se Jabir se bayan kiya."
"600","[AI-translation] Bashir [bin Maabad Sadusi] se aur unka naam: Zahm bin Maabad tha, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf hijrat karke aaye Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhara naam kya hai?"" Unhon ne kaha: Zahm. Aap ne farmaya: ""Balke tum Bashir ho."" Unhon ne kaha: Jab main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha [unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Ibn al-Khashashiya! Tum kab se Allah se nafrat karne lage? Tum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chal rahe ho."" Main ne kaha: ""Mere maa-baap Aap par qurban, main Allah se kuchh nafrat nahin karta, sari khair main ne payi""] Aap mushrikeen ki qabron par guzre. Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh bahut khair se peeche reh gaye"" teen baar. Aap musalmanon ki qabron par guzre. Aap ne farmaya: ""Unhon ne bahut khair pa li"" teen baar. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nazar ki; Aap ne ek shakhs ko qabron mein chalte dekha, do joote pehne hue. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae do jooton wale! Apne donon joote utaar do."" Shakhs ne dekha; jab us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, us ne apne donon joote utare, phir unhein pheink diya."
"601","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Hilal se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyon ke hujre shaakhon se dekhe oon ke kapde se dhake hue; main ne un se Ayesha ke ghar ke bare mein poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: Uska darwaza Shaam ki taraf tha. Main ne poocha: Ek pat tha ya do pat? Unhon ne jawab diya: Ek darwaza tha. Main ne poocha: Kis cheez ka tha? Unhon ne jawab diya: Arar ya sagwan lakdi ka."
"602","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai: Ek shakhs Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kaun sa sadqa ajr mein afzal hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhare baap ki qasam, tumhein zaroor bataya jayega: tum sadqa karo jab sehat-mand bakheel ho, faqr se darte ho, aur ghina ki umeed rakhte ho; takheer na karo yahan tak ke jab jaan halaq tak pahunche, tum kaho: Falan ke liye itna, aur falan ke liye itna, halanke woh falan ka ho chuka."
"603","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab tum mein se koi hajat mange, toh use halki talab se mange; be-shak uske liye woh hai jo uske liye muqaddar kiya gaya. Aur tum mein se koi apne dost ke paas na aaye phir uski tareef kare, phir uski peeth tod de."
"604","[AI-translation] Abu Azzah Yasar bin Abdullah Hudhali se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak jab Allah kisi bande ko kisi zameen mein wafat dene ka irada kare, Uske liye us mein ya: wahan hajat banata hai."
"605","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: ""Jo Allah chahe aur tum chaho!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum ne Allah ke liye shareek banaya?! Jo Allah akele chahe."
"606","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar ke sath bazaar gaya; woh chhoti gaane wali baandi par guzre. Unhon ne kaha: ""Agar shaitan kisi ko chhodta, toh is ladki ko chhodta."" 607/786 (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se: {""Aur logon mein se hain jo ghaflat wali baat khareedte hain""} [Luqman: 6]; unhon ne kaha: ""Gaana aur us jaisa."
"607","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se: {""Aur logon mein se hain jo ghaflat wali baat khareedte hain""} [Luqman: 6]; unhon ne kaha: ""Gaana aur us jaisa."
"608","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Salam phailao, salamti paoge; aur takabbur [al-asharah] shar hai."" Abu Muawiya ne kaha: al-Asharah: bekaar kaam hai."
"609","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ibn Masud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak tum zamane mein ho: uske faqeeh bahut, uske khateeb kam, uska sawal kam, uska ata zyada, amal us mein khwahish ka rehnuma hai. Aur tumhare baad zamana aayega: uske faqeeh kam, uske khateeb bahut, uska sawal bahut, uska ata kam, khwahish us mein amal ki rehnuma hogi, jaan lo ke husn-e-hadi aakhir zamane mein baaz amal se bahtar hai."
"610","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jurairi se, Abu Tufail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne [un se] poocha: ""Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan; main zameen par koi zinda mard nahin jaanta jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha mere siwa."" Unhon ne kaha: Aap safaid, khubsurat chehre wale the."
"611","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Achhi hidayat, achhi waza-qata, aur darmiyana-ravi; nabuwwat ke pachees hisson mein se hissa hain."
"612","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ikrimah se riwayat hai: Main ne Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha: ""Kya tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kabhi sheir kehte hue suna?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kabhi jab Aap apne ghar dakhil hote, Aap kehte: Tumhare paas khabar layega woh jise tum ne tosha nahin diya."
"613","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Be-shak woh Nabi ka kalima hai: ""Tumhare paas khabar layega woh jise tum ne tosha nahin diya."
"614","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Alqamah bin Waail [apne walid se] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: al-Karm; aur kaho: al-Habalah"" yani: angoor."
"615","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qurbani ka oont hankane wale shakhs par guzre. Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho."" Us ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Yeh qurbani ka oont hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us par sawar ho."" Us ne kaha: ""Yeh qurbani ka oont hai!"" Aap ne teesri ya chauthi mein farmaya: ""Tum par afsos, us par sawar ho."
"616","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Habib bin Shabhan Asadi se riwayat hai: ""Main ne Ammar ko farz namaz parhte dekha, phir unhon ne apne pehlu mein ek shakhs se kaha: Ae falan! Phir khade hue."
"617","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Sharid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe sawari par peeche bithaya; Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tumhare paas Umayyah bin Abi as-Salt ka sheir hai?"" Main ne kaha: Haan; main ne Aapko ek sheir sunaya, Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur [aur]"" yahan tak ke main ne Aapko sau sheir sunaye [Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh qareeb tha ke Islam le aata""]."
"618","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Qiyam-ul-lail na chhodo; be-shak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use nahin chhodte the; jab beemar ya sust hote, baithe hue namaz parhte."
"619","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kasrat se kehte: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main fikr aur ghum, aajzi aur susti, buzdili aur bukhl, qarz ke bojh, aur mardon ke ghalbe se teri panah mangta hun."
"620","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Dharr [unhon ne kaha] se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Baqee ki taraf nikle, aur main Aapke peeche chala, phir Aap ne mud kar mujhe dekha. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Dharr!"" Main ne kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasoolullah wa saadaik, aur main tum par qurban, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak kasrat wale [maal] qiyamat ke din qillat wale [ajr] honge, siwa jis ne yun aur yun kaha haq mein."" Main ne kaha: Allah aur uske Rasool behtar jaante hain. Aap ne farmaya: ""Yun"" [teen baar], phir hamare samne Uhud aaya Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Dharr!"" Main ne kaha: Labbaik Ya Rasoolullah wa saadaik, aur main tum par qurban, Aap ne farmaya: ""Mujhe khush nahin karta ke Uhud Aal Muhammad ke liye sona ho, phir unke paas shaam ko deenar ho ya Aap ne kaha miskal."" Phir hamare samne waadi aayi, Aap hate main ne samjha Aapko hajat hai, main kinare par baitha, aur mujh par der hui, Unhon ne kaha: Main Aap par dara, phir main ne Aapko suna goya kisi shakhs se sargoshi kar rahe hain, phir Aap mere paas akele nikle. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Woh shakhs kaun hai jis se tum sargoshi kar rahe the? Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum ne use suna?"" Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Jibreel mere paas aaye, aur mujhe khushkhabri di ke jo meri ummat mein se mara baghair Allah ke sath kisi ko shareek kiye jannat mein dakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Agarche zina kare aur chori kare? Aap ne kaha: Haan."
"621","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Saad ke baad kisi shakhs ko apne maa-baap samet fidya karte nahin dekha; main ne Aapko farmate hue suna: ""Teer chalo, mere maa-baap tum par qurban."
"622","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Buraidah se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid ki taraf nikle aur Abu Musa parh rahe the Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh kaun hai""? Main ne kaha: Main Buraidah hun tum par qurban, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ise Aal Dawood ki bansiyon mein se bansri di gayi hai."
"623","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka khadim tha, main baghair ijazat dakhil hota tha, phir ek din aaya, Aap ne farmaya: ""Waisa hi raho ae mere bete; be-shak tumhare baad ek muamla hua hai: ijazat ke baghair dakhil na hona."
"624","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Abu Shaasaa se riwayat hai ke Abu Saeed Khudri ne un se kaha: ""Ae mere bete!"
"625","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Mera nafs khabees hua; lekin use kehna chahiye: Mera nafs laqis hua."
"626","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Sahl bin Hunaif se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi na kahe: Mera nafs khabees hua; use kehna chahiye: Mera nafs laqis hua."
"627","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Shuraih bin Hani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hani bin Yazid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke jab woh apni qaum ke sath Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wafd ban kar aaye, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein Abu al-Hakam kehte hue suna. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah al-Hakam hai, usi ki taraf hukm hai; tum Abu al-Hakam kyun kehlate ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin, lekin meri qaum jab kisi cheez mein ikhtilaf karti hai mere paas aati hai; main unke darmiyan faisla karta hun; donon fareeq raazi hote hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh kitna achha hai!"" Phir farmaya: ""Tumhara beta kaun hai?"" Main ne jawab diya: Main ne kaha: Mere Shuraih, Abdullah, aur Muslim; Hani ke bete hain. Aap ne farmaya: ""Un mein bada kaun hai?"" Main ne kaha: ""Shuraih."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum Abu Shuraih ho."" Aap ne unke liye aur unki aulaad ke liye dua ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [qaum ko] suna un mein se ek shakhs ko Abd al-Hajar kehte hue; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poocha: ""Tumhara naam kya hai?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Abd al-Hajar."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin. Tum Abdullah ho."" Shuraih ne kaha: Jab Hani apne mulk wapas jane laga, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Mujhe batao kis se jannat wajib hoti hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par husn-e-kalam, aur khana khilana lazim hai."
"628","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi sabab-e-hadees aur jald-baazi ke baghair) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tez aaye jab hum baithe the; Aapki tezi ne hamein ghabra diya; jab Aap hamare paas pahunche, salam kiya, phir farmaya: ""Main tumhare paas tez aaya; tumhein Lailatul Qadr batane ke liye, phir main use mere aur tumhare darmiyan bhool gaya, use aakhri ashre mein talash karo."
"629","[AI-translation] (Sahih jumla-e-ambiya ke baghair) Abu Wahb [Jushami] se aur unhein [Nabi se] sohbat thi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ambiya ke naamon se naam rakho. Allah Azza wa Jalla ko sab se mehbub naam: Abdullah, aur Abdur Rahman, aur sab se sachche Haris, aur Hammam, aur sab se bure: Harb: Harb, aur Murrah."
"630","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se ek shakhs ka ladka paida hua aur us ne use Qasim nam diya. Hum ne kaha: ""Hum tumhein Abu al-Qasim kehte hain lekin izzat nahin karte."" Us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di; Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne bete ka naam Abdur Rahman rakho."
"631","[AI-translation] Sahl se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mundhir bin Abi Usaid Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laye gaye jab woh paida hue; Aap ne use apni raan par rakha aur Abu Usaid baithe the Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne samne kisi cheez mein mashghool hue; Abu Usaid ne apne bete ka hukm diya phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki raan se uthaya gaya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hoshiyar hue Aap ne farmaya: ""Bachcha kahan hai?"" Abu Usaid ne jawab diya: Hum ne use palat diya, Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: ""Uska naam kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Falan. Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin; uska naam Mundhir hai."" Us ne use us din Mundhir nam diya."
"632","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah ke paas badtareen naam woh mard hai jo malikul amlak nam rakhe."
"633","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Talq bin Habib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main shafaat ke sab se zyada jhutlane walon mein se tha; main ne Jabir se poocha; unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Tulaiq! Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Woh aag mein dakhil hone ke baad nikalenge aur hum parhte hain jo tum parhte ho."
"634","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aasiyah ka naam badla, aur farmaya: ""Tum Jamilah ho."
"635","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata se riwayat hai ke woh Zainab bint Abi Salamah ke paas dakhil hue; unhon ne un se unke paas unki behan ke naam ke bare mein poocha? [Unhon ne kaha:] Main ne jawab diya: ""Uska naam Barrah hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Uska naam badlo; be-shak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zainab bint Jahsh se nikah kiya jab uska naam Barrah tha; Aap ne uska naam badal kar Zainab rakha. Aap Umm Salamah ke paas dakhil hue jab un se nikah kiya jab mera naam Barrah tha; Aap ne unhein mujhe pukarte suna: Barrah. Aap ne farmaya: Apne nafs ko paak na thehrao; Allah tum mein se naiki wali aur fajira ko zyada jaanta hai. Use nam do: Zainab."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Woh Zainab hai."" Main ne un se poocha: ""Nam do? [yani: us naam se]."
"636","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek shakhs ka zikr hua jise Shihab kaha jata tha. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Balke tum Hisham ho."
"637","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Mutee se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Fath Makkah ke din farmate hue suna: ""Aaj ke baad qiyamat tak koi Quraishi sabr se qatl nahin kiya jayega."" Islam mein Quraish ke nafarmanon mein se Mutee ke siwa kisi ne nahin paya; unka naam Aas tha; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein nam diya: Mutee."
"638","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ae Ayesh! Yeh Jibreel [woh] tumhein salam kehte hain."" Unhon ne kaha: [Main ne jawab diya:] ""Wa alaihis salam wa rahmatullah [wa barakatuh]."" Unhon ne kaha: Woh woh dekhte hain jo main nahin dekhti [doosri riwayat mein: tum woh dekhte ho jo main nahin dekhta Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) murad hain]."
"639","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Laila Bashir ki biwi se Bashir bin al-Khashashiya se bayan karti hain. Unka naam: Zahm tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein nam diya: Bashir."
"640","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ke Juwairiyah ka naam Barrah tha; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use Juwairiyah nam diya."
"641","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar main zinda raha, main apni ummat ko mana karunga Insha Allah ke un mein se koi Barakah, Nafe, aur Aflah nam rakhe [main nahin jaanta Aap ne kaha: Rafe ya nahin?] kaha jaye: Yahan Barakah hai? Toh kaha jaye: Yahan nahin hai."" Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gaye aur us se mana nahin kiya."
"642","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Un se doosre tareeq se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irada kiya ke mana karein ke Yala, Barakah, Nafe, Yasar, Aflah, aur us jaisa nam rakha jaye; phir Aap uske baad khamosh hue, phir kuchh nahin kaha."
"643","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon se alahdagi ki, toh main ne Rabah ko paya; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ghulam, phir main ne pukara: Ae Rabah! Mere liye Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat lo."
"644","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho; be-shak main Aba al-Qasim hun."
"645","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bazaar mein the; ek shakhs ne pukara: ""Ae Aba al-Qasim!"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) uski taraf mutawajjuh hue. Us ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main ne ise pukara."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho."
"646","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera naam Yusuf rakha, mujhe apni god mein bithaya, aur mere sir par hath phera."
"647","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek shakhs ka ladka paida hua aur us ne use Muhammad nam dene ka irada kiya [yahan riwayat mein: ke Ansari ne kaha: main ne use apni gardan par uthaya, phir use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya] [doosri mein: uska ladka paida hua, phir unhon ne use Muhammad nam dene ka irada kiya]; Aap ne farmaya: ""Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho; be-shak mujhe [teesri riwayat mein: bheja gaya] Qasim banaya gaya, main tumhare darmiyan taqseem karta hun."
"648","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Mera ladka paida hua; main use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya; Aap ne use Ibrahim nam diya, use khajoor se tehneek di, uske liye barkat ki dua ki, aur use mujhe de diya."" Woh Abu Musa ki sab se badi aulaad tha."
"649","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Saeed bin al-Musayyab se, unke walid se, unke dada se: ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye; Aap ne poocha: ""Tumhara naam kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Hazn [ghum]."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum Sahl [aasan] ho."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main woh naam nahin badluga jo mere walid ne mujhe diya!"" Ibn al-Musayyab ne kaha: Uske baad hum mein sakhti rahi. [Doosre tareeq se Saeed bin al-Musayyab se ke unke dada Hazn ne use mursal zikr kiya.]"
"650","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se ek shakhs ka ladka paida hua aur us ne use Qasim nam diya; Ansar ne kaha: ""Hum tumhein Aba al-Qasim nahin kehte, aur tumhein aankh ki thandak nahin dete,"" woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, Aap se woh kaha jo Ansar ne kaha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ansar ne achha kiya; mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho; be-shak main Qasim hun."
"651","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Hanafiya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ali ke liye rukhsat thi; unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Agar mere baad ladka paida ho kya main use tumhare naam se nam dun, aur tumhari kuniyat se kuniyat dun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Haan."
"652","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke Aapke naam aur kuniyat ko jama kiya jaye, aur farmaya: ""Main Aba al-Qasim hun; Allah deta hai, main taqseem karta hun."
"653","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai: ""Ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek majlis tak pahunche jis mein Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul tha aur woh Abdullah bin Ubayy ke Islam lane se pehle tha us ne kaha: Hamein apni majlis mein takleef na do! Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Saad bin Ubadah ke paas dakhil hue aur farmaya: Ae Saad! Kya tum nahin sunte Abu Hubab kya kehta hai?!, Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul murad hai."
"654","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas andar tashreef late the aur mera chhota bhai tha jise Abu Umair kuniyat di jati thi, uska nughair tha jis se woh khelta tha, phir woh mar gaya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andar tashreef laye aur use ghumgeen dekha. Aap ne poocha: ""Uska kya haal hai?"" Un se kaha gaya: Uska nughra mar gaya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Umair! Nughair ne kya kiya?!"
"655","[AI-translation] Ibrahim [yani Nakhyi] se riwayat hai: ""Ke Abdullah ne Alqamah ko kuniyat di: Abu Shibl, halanke uske ladka paida nahin hua tha."
"656","[AI-translation] Alqamah [yani Ibn Waail] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Abdullah ne mujhe kuniyat di is se pehle ke mere ladka paida ho."
"657","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Nabiullah! Kya tum mujhe kuniyat nahin doge?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne bete se kuniyat lo"" yani Abdullah bin Zubair, phir unhein kuniyat di jati thi: Umm Abdullah."
"658","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad se riwayat hai: Be-shak Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke sab se mehbub naamon mein se Abu Turab tha; woh us se pukare jane par khush hote the. Use [Abu Turab] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke siwa kisi ne nam nahin diya: woh Fatima se naraz hue, phir nikle aur masjid ki deewar se lag kar lete; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aapke peeche aaye aur poocha: Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh deewar mein leta hai."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye jab uski peeth mitti se bhari thi; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) uski peeth se mitti ponchhne lage, aur farmate: ""Baitho Abu Turab!"
"659","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare khajoor ke bagh mein the Abu Talha ke bagh mein Aap apni hajat ke liye nikle, aur Bilal [Aapke peeche, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko izzat dete hue ke Aapke] pehlu mein chalte hue Aap qabr par guzre phir khade hue, yahan tak ke Bilal Aap tak pahunche, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par afsos ae Bilal! Kya tum sunte ho jo main sunta hun?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Main kuchh nahin sunta,"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Is qabr wala azab diya jata hai."" Yahudi paya gaya."
"660","[AI-translation] Qais [yani Ibn Abi Hazim] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muawiya ko apne chhote bhai se kehte hue suna: Ladke ko sawari par peeche bithaya, phir us ne inkar kiya; Muawiya ne use kaha: ""Tum ne bura adab kiya."" Qais ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sufyan ko kehte hue suna: Apne bhai ko chhodo."
"661","[AI-translation] Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat hai: ""Jab dost zyada hon, haq mangne wale zyada hote hain."" Main ne Musa se kaha: Haq mangne wale kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Huqooq."
"662","[AI-translation] Mutarrif se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Imran bin Husain ki Kufa se Basra tak sohbat ki; koi manzil woh utarte magar woh mujhe sheir sunate: Aur unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak kinayon mein jhoot se gunjaish hai."
"663","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Kaab se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak sheir mein hikmat hai."
"664","[AI-translation] Aswad bin Saree se riwayat hai, [unhon ne kaha: main shayar tha, phir main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya phir] main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak main ne apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ki hamd se tareef ki."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jaan lo tumhara Rabb hamd pasand karta hai,"" aur us par izafa nahin kiya."
"665","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mard ka pait peep se bhar jaye [yahan tak ke] use kharab kare, us se bahtar hai ke woh sheir se bhare."
"666","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hassan bin Sabit ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikeen ki hajw mein ijazat mangi. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Phir mera nasab kya hoga?"" Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhein un se nikalunga jaise baal aante se nikala jata hai."
"667","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ayesha ke paas Hassan ko bura kehne laga, unhon ne kaha: Use bura na kaho; be-shak ""woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf se difa karta tha."
"668","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Sheir kalam ki manzil par hai, uska husn kalam ke husn jaisa hai, aur uska qubh kalam ke qubh jaisa hai."
"669","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh kehti theen: ""Sheir mein se husn hai aur mein se qubh hai, husn lo aur qubh chhodo, aur main ne Kaab bin Malik ke sheir mein se asharon mein se riwayat kiya, un mein se qaseeda jis mein chalees sheir hain, aur us se kam."
"670","[AI-translation] Shuraih se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha: ""Kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sheir mein se kisi se tamassul karte the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Aap Abdullah bin Rawahah ke sheir mein se kisi se tamassul karte the: ""Tumhare paas khabar layega woh jise tum ne tosha nahin diya."
"671","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se ek ka pait peep se bhar jaye uske liye us se bahtar hai ke woh sheir se bhare."
"672","[AI-translation] Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: {Aur shayaron ki pairwi gumrah karte hain} [Shuara: 224] Uske qoul tak: {Aur ke woh kehte hain jo woh nahin karte} [Shuara: 226]. Us mein se mansookh hua aur istisna kiya, phir farmaya: {Siwa woh jo iman laye} unke qoul tak: {wapas honge}."
"673","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ya dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya phir wazeh kalam se baat ki, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak bayan mein jadu hai, aur be-shak sheir mein hikmat hai."
"674","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak logon mein sab se bade jurm wala insan shayar hai jo qabile ko uske qaid se hajw kare, aur mard jo apne baap se inkar kare."
"675","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein mashriq se do khateeb aaye, phir khade hue aur baat ki phir baithe. Aur Sabit bin Qais khade hue; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke khateeb ne baat ki, phir log un donon ki baat par tajjub karne lage. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba dene khade hue, phir farmaya: ""Ae logon! Apni baat kaho, be-shak kalam ko cheerhna [mubalagha] shaitan se hai."" Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak bayan mein jadu hai."
"676","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Umar ke paas khutba diya aur baat zyada ki; Umar ne kaha: ""Be-shak khutbon mein zyada baat shaitan ki sargoshi mein se hai."
"677","[AI-translation] Abu Yazid ya: Maan bin Yazid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Apni masjidon mein jama ho, aur jab qaum jama ho toh mujhe khabar do."" Jo pehle aaya hamare paas aaya, woh baitha aur hum mein se ek bolne wale ne baat ki, phir kaha: ""Be-shak sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jiske siwa hamd ka maqsad nahin aur na uske peeche raasta hai,"" toh Aap ghadabnak hue aur khade hue; hum ne aapas mein malamat ki, hum ne kaha: Jo pehle aaya hamare paas aaya, phir woh doosri masjid ki taraf gaya aur us mein baitha, hum uske paas aaye aur us se baat ki, woh hamare sath aaya aur apni majlis mein ya apni majlis ke qareeb baitha. Phir kaha: ""Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jo chaha us ne apne samne kiya, aur jo chaha us ne apne peeche kiya, aur be-shak bayan mein jadu hai."" Phir Aap ne hamein hukm diya aur sikhaya."
"678","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek raat jaage, phir farmaya: ""Kaash mere sahaba mein se naik mard mere paas aaye; raat ko meri hifazat kare,"" tab hum ne hathiyar ki aawaz suni, Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh kaun hai?"" Unhon ne kaha: Saad Ya Rasoolullah! Main aaya Aapki hifazat karunga, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) soye yahan tak ke hum ne Aapke kharrate sune."
"679","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madina mein ghabrahat thi; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Talha ka ghoda udhar liya jise Mandub kaha jata tha Aap us par sawar hue. Jab wapas aaye, Aap ne farmaya: ""Hum ne kuchh nahin dekha, aur hum ne use samandar paya."
"680","[AI-translation] Nafe se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ibn Umar apne bete ko lahn [zabaan ki ghalti] par marte the."
"681","[AI-translation] Ayesha zawja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Logon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kahinon ke bare mein poocha? Aap ne un se farmaya: ""Woh kuchh nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Woh baat bayan karte hain jo sachchi hoti hai?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Woh [haq ka] kalima hai jise shaitan uchak leta hai, phir use apne wali ke kaan mein murghi ke kukdune ki tarah gunjunata hai, phir woh us mein sau se zyada jhoot milate hain."
"682","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the, hadi ne hudi ki, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Narmi kar ae Anjasha tum par afsos sheeshon [auraton] par."
"683","[AI-translation] Umar [mere khayal mein, mere walid ne shak kiya] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Jhoot mein se shakhs ke liye kafi hai ke woh har suna bayan kare."
"684","[AI-translation] Unhon ne kaha: Aur mere khayal mein unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: ""Kya kinayon mein musalman ke liye jhoot se kifayat nahin?"
"685","[AI-translation] Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Mujhe shakhs par tajjub hai jo taqdeer se bhagta hai, halanke woh use aane wala hai! Aur woh apne bhai ki aankh mein tinkah dekhta hai, aur apni aankh mein shahteer chhod deta hai! Aur apne bhai ke nafs se keena nikalta hai, aur apne nafs mein keena chhod deta hai! Aur main ne apna raaz kisi ke paas nahin rakha phir main ne use uske phailane par malamat ki, aur main use kaise malamat karun halanke main us se tang ho chuka tha?"
"686","[AI-translation] Muhammad Ibn al-Hanafiya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Aql-mand nahin jo maroof se suhbat na kare jiski suhbat se bachne ki gunjaish na ho; yahan tak ke Allah uske liye faraaj ya raasta banaye."
"687","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo doodh dene wali bakri de ya rasta bataye ya Aap ne farmaya: raasta uske liye gardan aazad karne ke barabar hai."
"688","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se, woh use marfu karte hain [unhon ne kaha: phir uske baad unhon ne kaha: main use marfu ke siwa nahin jaanta] unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhara apne dol se apne bhai ke dol mein dalna sadqa hai, aur tumhara maroof ka hukm aur munkar se rokna sadqa hai, aur tumhara apne bhai ke chehre par muskurana sadqa hai, aur tumhara logon ke raaste se patthar aur kaanta aur haddi hatana tumhare liye sadqa hai, aur tumhara gumrah zameen mein shakhs ko rasta dikhana sadqa hai."
"689","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Allah lanat kare us par jo andhe ko raaste se gumrah kare."
"690","[AI-translation] Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo do bachiyon ki parwarish kare yahan tak ke woh baligh hon, main aur woh jannat mein in donon ki tarah dakhil honge,"" aur Muhammad [bin Abd al-Aziz] ne shahadat aur darmiyani se ishara kiya."
"691","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai: Duniya mein do darwaze jald kiye jate hain baghawat aur qata-rehmi."
"692","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak qiyamat ke din mere wali muttaqi hain; agarche nasab nasab se zyada qareeb ho, toh log mere paas aamal lekar na aayein, aur tum duniya lekar aao use apni gardanon par uthaye hue, phir kaho: Ae Muhammad! Toh main kahunga yun aur yun: nahin"" aur donon pehluon mein munh phera."
"693","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main kisi ko is aayat par amal karte nahin dekhta: {Ae logon be-shak Hum ne tumhein mard aur aurat se paida kiya} yahan tak ke pahunche: {Be-shak tum mein Allah ke paas sab se izzat wala sab se muttaqi hai} [Hujurat: 13]. Shakhs doosre se kehta hai: Main tum se zyada izzat wala hun! Koi ek doosre se zyada izzat wala nahin magar Allah ke taqwe se."
"694","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ""Tum izzat kise samajhte ho? Allah ne izzat bayan kar di, phir Allah ke paas tum mein sab se izzat wala sab se muttaqi hai, tum hasab kise samajhte ho? Hasab mein tum mein afzal husn-e-akhlaq wala hai."
"695","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Roohein jama lashkar hain; jo ek doosre ko pehchanein mil jayein, jo ek doosre ka inkar karein juda ho jayein."
"696","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Roohein jama lashkar hain; jo ek doosre ko pehchanein mil jayein, jo ek doosre ka inkar karein juda ho jayein."
"697","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jab charwaha apni bakriyon mein ho, bhediya us par hamla kare aur us mein se bakri le, charwaha use talash kare, phir bhediya uski taraf mutawajjuh ho, phir kahe: Uske liye Sabu ke din kaun hai? Uske liye mere siwa koi charwaha nahin."" Logon ne kaha: ""Subhanallah!"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main us par iman rakhta hun; main, Abu Bakr, aur Umar."
"698","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) janaze mein the; Aap ne kuchh liya, phir use zameen mein thonkne lage, phir farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi nahin magar uska aag mein thikana, aur uska jannat mein thikana likha gaya."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya hum apni kitab par bharosa na karein, aur amal chhod dein?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Amal karo! Har aasan kiya gaya jis ke liye woh paida hua."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Jo khush-bakhton mein se tha woh khushi ke amal ke liye aasan kiya jayega, aur jo bad-bakhton mein se tha woh bad-bakhti ke amal ke liye aasan kiya jayega"" phir parha: {Phir jis ne diya aur dara, aur husna ki tasdeeq ki ...} Aayatein [Lail: 5-7]."
"699","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khadhf se mana kiya, aur farmaya: ""Be-shak woh shikar ko qatl nahin karta, dushman ko zakhmi nahin karta; woh aankh phodta hai aur daant todta hai."
"700","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hawa ne logon ko Makkah ke raaste mein liya jab Umar Hajj kar rahe the phir tez hui, Umar ne apne ird-gird se poocha: ""Yeh hawa kya hai?"" Unhon ne kuchh jawab nahin diya! Main ne apni oontni daudayi; Aap tak pahuncha. Main ne kaha: Mujhe pahunchi ke tum ne hawa ke bare mein poocha? Aur main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Hawa Allah ki rooh mein se hai; rehmat samet aati hai, aur azab samet aati hai toh use bura na kaho, Allah se uski khair mango, aur uske shar se panah mango."
"701","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya mein hamein namaz-e-Subh parhayi; raat ki baarish ke baad, jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz se phire Aap logon ki taraf mutawajjuh hue, phir farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho tumhare Rabb ne kya farmaya?"" Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur uske Rasool behtar jaante hain. Aap ne farmaya: ""Mere bandon mein se aaj subah ek mera momin hai aur ek kafir; phir jis ne kaha: Hamein Allah ke fazl aur rehmat se baarish hui, toh woh mera momin hai aur sitare ka kafir hai, aur jis ne kaha: Falan aur falan sitare se, toh woh mera kafir hai, sitare ka momin hai."
"702","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Teerah shirk hai; hum mein se nahin, lekin Allah use tawakkul se door karta hai."
"703","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Teerah nahin, aur uski bahtareen faal hai."" Unhon ne poocha: Faal kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Achha kalima jo tum mein se ek sune."
"704","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Mujhe ummatein mausam mein Hajj ke dinon mein dikhayi gayein, phir mujhe meri ummat ki kasrat ne tajjub mein dala; unhon ne maidan aur pahaad bhar diye. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Kya tum raazi ho? Aap ne kaha: Haan, ae mere Rabb! Aap ne farmaya: Be-shak unke sath sattar hazaar hain jo baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge, woh jo ruqya nahin mangte aur daagh nahin lagate, aur teerah nahin karte, aur apne Rabb par tawakkul karte hain."" Ukashah ne kaha: Allah se dua karo ke woh mujhe un mein se banaye. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah use un mein se bana."" Phir doosre shakhs ne kaha: Allah se dua karo ke woh mujhe un mein se banaye. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par Ukkashah sabqat le gaya."
"705","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Adwa nahin aur teerah nahin, aur mujhe achhi faal pasand hai; achha kalima."
"706","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Hayyah [bin Habis] Tamimi se riwayat hai ke unke walid ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Ullu mein kuchh nahin, aur teerah ki sab se sachchi faal hai, aur nazar haq hai."
"707","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Abdullah bin as-Sayib se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hudaibiya ke saal, jab Usman bin Affan ka zikr kiya ke Suhail ko uski qaum ne uske paas bheja tha, unhon ne sulah ki, ke woh un se is saal wapas jaye, aur unhein agle teen khali kare, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya jab woh aaya. Kaha gaya: ""Suhail aaya"" ""Allah tumhara muamla aasan kare."" Aur Abdullah bin as-Sayib ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko paya tha."
"708","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Sahl bin Saad se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar nahusat kisi cheez mein ho, toh aurat, ghode, aur makan mein hai."
"709","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum ghar mein the jis mein hamari tadaad zyada thi, aur hamare amwal zyada the? Phir hum doosre ghar muntaqil hue, phir hamari tadaad kam hui aur hamare amwal kam hue?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use chhodo, ya use chhod do, jabke woh mazmoom hai."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Uski sanad mein nazar hai."
"710","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah chheenk ko pasand karta hai, aur jamahi ko na-pasand karta hai; jab chheenke phir Allah ki hamd kare toh har musalman par haq hai jis ne use suna ke use jawab de, aur jamahi woh shaitan se hai [jab tum mein se koi jamahi le], toh use rokna chahiye jitna ho sake, phir jab kahe: haah, shaitan us par hansta hai."
"711","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab [tum mein se koi] chheenke toh use kehna chahiye: Alhamdulillah, jab kahe [Alhamdulillah], toh uske bhai ya sathi ko kehna chahiye: Yarhamukallah, jab use kahe: Yarhamukallah, toh use [woh] kehna chahiye: Yahdikumullah, wa yuslih balakum."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Is bab mein sab se sabit woh hai jo is hadees mein riwayat hua."
"712","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Masud se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Musalman ke liye musalman par chaar hain: jab beemar ho uski iyadat kare, jab mare use dekhe, jab use bulaye use jawab de, aur jab chheenke use jawab de."
"713","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein saat ka hukm diya aur saat se mana kiya: hamein beemar ki iyadat, janaze ke peeche chalne, chheenkne wale ko jawab, qasam poori karne, mazloom ki madad, salam phailane, aur dawat qabool karne ka hukm diya. Aur hamein sone ki anguthiyon aur chandi ke bartano aur meesaron aur qassiya aur istabraq aur dibaj aur resham se mana kiya."
"714","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Jamrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko suna jab jawab dete: Afanallah wa iyyakum minan nar. Yarhamukumullah."
"715","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe the; ek shakhs chheenka aur Allah ki hamd ki, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use farmaya: ""Yarhamukallah."" Phir doosra chheenka, Aap ne use kuchh nahin kaha, Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Tum ne doosre ko jawab diya aur mujhe kuchh nahin kaha."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us ne Allah ki hamd ki, aur tum khamosh rahe."
"716","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chheenke; Aap ne un mein se ek ko jawab diya, doosre ko jawab nahin diya, Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum ne isko jawab diya aur mujhe jawab nahin diya?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak is ne Allah ki hamd ki, aur tum ne Uski hamd nahin ki."
"717","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se doosre tareeq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe, un mein se ek doosre se ashraf tha, phir un mein se shareef chheenka, phir us ne Allah ki hamd nahin ki, aur Aap ne use jawab nahin diya, aur doosra chheenka phir us ne Allah ki hamd ki, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use jawab diya, phir shareef ne kaha: Main Aapke paas chheenka phir Aap ne mujhe jawab nahin diya, aur yeh doosra chheenka phir Aap ne use jawab diya! Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak is ne Allah ko yaad kiya phir main ne use yaad kiya, aur tum ne Allah ko bhoolaya phir main ne tumhein bhoolaya."
"718","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke jab woh chheenke aur un se kaha jaye Yarhamukallah. Unhon ne kaha: ""Yarhamunallah wa iyyakum, wa yaghfir lana wa lakum."
"719","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab tum mein se koi chheenke toh use kehna chahiye: Alhamdulillah Rabbil Aalameen. Aur jawab dene wale ko kehna chahiye: Yarhamukallah. Aur use kehna chahiye: Yaghfirullah li wa lakum."
"720","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Salamah [yani Ibn al-Akwa] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chheenka Aap ne farmaya: ""Yarhamukallah,"" phir doosri baar chheenka, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Yeh zukam wala hai."
"721","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ka beta chheenka Abu Bakr ya Abu Umar phir kaha: Aab. Ibn Umar ne kaha: ""Aab kya hai? Be-shak Aab shaitanon mein se ek shaitan ka naam hai jise us ne chheenk aur hamd ke darmiyan banaya."
"722","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Use ek aur do aur teen jawab do, phir jo iske baad ho toh woh zukam hai."
"723","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahudi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chheenkne ka bahanah karte the umeed ke Aap unhein kahenge: ""Yarhamukumullah,"" phir Aap kehte: ""Yahdikumullah, wa yuslih balakum."
"724","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Burdah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Musa ke paas dakhil hua aur woh [unki beti] Umm al-Fadhl bint al-Abbas ke ghar mein the main chheenka phir unhon ne mujhe jawab nahin diya, aur woh chheenkin phir unhon ne unhein jawab diya, main ne apni walida ko khabar di; jab unke paas aayin, unhon ne un par hamla kiya, aur kaha: Mera beta chheenka phir tum ne use jawab nahin diya, aur tum chheenkin phir tum ne use jawab diya, Unhon ne un se kaha: ""Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke phir Allah ki hamd kare toh use jawab do, aur agar woh Allah ki hamd na kare toh use jawab na do. Aur tumhara beta chheenka phir us ne Allah ki hamd nahin ki toh main ne use jawab nahin diya, aur woh chheenkin phir unhon ne Allah ki hamd ki toh main ne unhein jawab diya, Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne achha kiya."
"725","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Muadh se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche sawar tha Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Muadh!"" Main ne kaha: Labbaik wa saadaik, phir Aap ne us jaisa teen baar kaha: ""Kya tum jaante ho bandon par Allah ka haq kya hai? [Main ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: bandon par Allah ka haq] ke woh Uski ibadat karein aur uske sath kisi ko shareek na karein."" Phir ghadi bhar chale, phir farmaya: ""Ae Muadh!"" Main ne kaha: Labbaik wa saadaik, Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho Allah Azza wa Jalla par bandon ka haq kya hai jab woh aisa karein? Ke Woh unhein azab na de."
"726","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Kaab se aur woh Kaab ke bete mein se unke rahnuma the jab woh andhe hue unhon ne kaha: Main ne Kaab bin Malik ko suna, uski hadees bayan karte hue jab woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Tabuk ki jang mein peeche reh gaye, phir Allah ne un par tauba qabool ki: Aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hum par Allah ki tauba ka elaan kiya jab Fajr parhi, phir log mujh se fauj fauj milne lage; mujhe tauba par mubarak dete hue, kehte hue: Tumhein Allah ki tauba mubarak ho, yahan tak ke main masjid mein dakhil hua, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ird-gird log the. Meri taraf Talhah bin Ubaidullah uth kar daudte hue aaye, yahan tak ke unhon ne mujh se musafaha kiya aur mubarak di, Allah ki qasam Muhajireen mein se unke siwa koi mard meri taraf nahin utha, main use Talhah ke liye nahin bhoolta."
"727","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai ke log Saad bin Muadh ke hukm par utre; unhon ne unhein bheja, woh gadhe par aaye. Jab masjid ke qareeb pahunche, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Apne bahtareen, ya sayyid ki taraf aao."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Saad! Be-shak woh tumhare hukm par utre hain."" Saad ne kaha: Main un mein faisla karta hun: ke unke ladne wale qatl kiye jayein, aur unki aulaad qaidi banayi jaye. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum ne Allah ke hukm se faisla kiya"" ya Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum ne Badshah [Allah] ke hukm se faisla kiya."
"728","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zyada unhein koi shakhs dekhne mein mehbub na tha; jab woh Aapko dekhte, woh Aapke liye khade nahin hote the kyunke woh jaante the Aap use na-pasand karte hain."
"729","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha Ummul Momineen (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne logon mein se kisi ko nahin dekha jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se baat, guftagu, aur baithak mein Fatima se zyada mushabeh ho. Unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhein aate dekhte, Aap unhein khush-aamdeed kehte, unki taraf uthte, unhein bosa dete, unka hath pakadte, unhein late yahan tak ke unhein apni jagah bithate. Aur jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke paas aate, woh Aapko khush-aamdeed kehtin, Aapki taraf uthtin [Aapka hath pakadtin], phir Aapko bosa detin. Aur woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Aapki us beemari mein dakhil huin jis mein Aap wafat pa gaye, Aap ne khush-aamdeed kaha aur bosa diya, un se sargoshi ki, phir woh royeen! Phir un se sargoshi ki, phir woh hanseen! Main ne auraton se kaha: ""Main samajhti thi ke unhein auraton par fazeelat hai; toh woh auraton mein se hain! Jab roti thin achanak hansti thin!"" Main ne un se poocha: ""Aapko unhon ne kya kaha?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Phir main raaz phailane wali hun!"" Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gaye, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujh se sargoshi ki: ""Be-shak main marunga."" Main royi. Phir mujh se sargoshi ki: ""Be-shak tum apne ghar walon mein se pehle mujh se milogi."" Main us se khush hui, aur woh mujhe tajjub mein dala."
"730","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beemar hue; hum ne Aapke peeche namaz parhi jab Aap baithe the Abu Bakr logon ko Aapki takbeer sunate the. Aap hamari taraf mutawajjuh hue aur hamein khada dekha; Aap ne hamein ishara kiya phir hum baithe, hum ne Aapki namaz ke sath baithe hue namaz parhi. Jab salam phera, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum qareeb the ke Faris aur Room ka fail karo: woh apne badshahon par khade hote hain jab woh baithe hon, toh aisa na karo, apne imamon ki pairwi karo, agar baithe hue namaz parhe toh baithe hue namaz parho."
"731","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi jamahi le, toh use apna hath apne munh par rakhna chahiye; be-shak shaitan us mein dakhil hota hai."
"732","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab jamahi le toh use apna hath apne munh par rakhna chahiye; be-shak woh shaitan se hai."
"733","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umm Haram Milhan ki beti ke paas dakhil hote; woh Aapko khilatin, aur woh Ubadah bin as-Samit ke nikah mein theen, Aap ne unhein khilaya aur unka sir saaf karne lageen, Aap soye, phir hanste hue jaage."
"734","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Qais bin Aasim Saadi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh oon walon ke sayyid hain."" Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kaun sa maal hai jis mein mujh par talib ya mehmaan ki taraf se zimma nahin?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bahtareen maal chalees hai; zyada sath hai; sain walon ke liye afsos hai, siwa jis ne kareem diya, doodh dene wali di, motee zibah ki, phir khaya, aur khilaya qanaat karne wale aur mangne wale ko."" Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Yeh akhlaq kitne kareem hain; waadi halal nahin jismein main hun meri nemat ki kasrat se. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum atiye ke sath kya karte ho?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Main kunwari oontni deta hun, aur budhi oontni deta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum maniha [doodh ke atiye] mein kya karte ho"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main oontni deta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum udhar mange sanwd mein kya karte ho?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Log subah apni rassiyon samet jate hain; koi shakhs oont ko rokta nahin jise woh lagam deta hai, phir use rokta hai jab tak woh chahe, yahan tak ke wahi use wapas kare, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhara maal tumhein zyada mehbub hai, ya tumhare aazad-kardon ka maal?"" [Unhon ne kaha: Mera maal]. Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak tumhare liye tumhare maal mein se woh hai jo tum ne khaya phir khatam kiya, ya diya phir guzar diya, aur baqi tumhare aazad-kardon ke liye hai."" Main ne kaha: ""Shak nahin, agar main wapas gaya, main uski tadaad kam karunga."" Jab unhein maut aayi, unhon ne apne beton ko jama kiya, aur kaha: ""Ae mere beton! Mujh se lo; tum kisi se nahin loge jo tumhare liye mujh se zyada khair-khwah ho: mujh par nauha na karna; be-shak Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nauha nahin kiya gaya. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko nauhe se mana karte suna; mujhe mere kapdon mein kafan dena jin mein main namaz parhta tha; apne badon ko sardar banao; agar tum apne badon ko sardar banaoge, tumhare walid ke liye tum mein khalifa rahega, aur agar tum apne chhoton ko sardar banaoge, tumhare bade logon par zaleel honge aur tum se be-raghbat honge. Apni maeeshat durust karo; be-shak us mein logon se mangne se ghina hai; aur mangne se bacho, be-shak woh shakhs ki aakhri kamayi hai. Jab tum mujhe dafan karo, meri qabr barabar karo; be-shak mere aur Bani Bakr bin Waail ke is qabile ke darmiyan kuchh tha: zakhm, phir main bewaqoof se aman mein nahin jo koi muamla laye jo tumhare deen mein aib dakhil kare."
"735","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein aur Fatima bint Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khatkhataya, phir farmaya: ""Kya tum namaz nahin parhte?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak hamari jaanein Allah ke paas hain; jab Woh chahe hamein uthaye, Woh hamein uthayega!"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chale gaye mujhe kuchh wapas nahin kiya. Phir main ne suna jab peeth phere hue, Aap apni raan par marte hue kehte: {Aur insan sab cheezon se zyada jhagadne wala hai} [Kahf: 54]."
"736","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne use apni peshani apne hath se marte dekha aur kehte hue: ""Ae Ahl-e-Iraq! Kya tum samajhte ho ke main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot bolta hun! Tumhare liye khushi aur mujh par gunah hoga? Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se kisi ki [joote ki] tasma toot jaye, toh woh apni doosri jooti mein na chale yahan tak ke use durust kare."
"737","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu al-Aliya Bara se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin as-Samit mere paas se guzre; main ne unke liye kursi rakhi; woh baithe. Main ne un se kaha: ""Ibn Abi Ziyad ne namaz takheer ki, tum kya hukm dete ho?"" Unhon ne meri raan par mara mujhe lagta hai unhon ne kaha: yahan tak ke us mein nishan hua phir kaha: Main ne [apne khaleel] Abu Dharr se poocha jaise tum ne mujh se poocha; unhon ne meri raan par mara jaise main ne tumhari raan par mara aur farmaya: [Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas wuzu lekar aaya; Aap ne apna sir hilaya, aur apne hont kaate! Main ne kaha: Mere maa-baap Aap par qurban, kya main ne Aapko takleef di? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin, lekin tum ameeron ya imamon ko paoge jo namaz ko uske waqt se takheer karte hain."" Main ne kaha: Tum mujhe kya hukm dete ho? Unhon ne kaha:] ""Namaz waqt par parho; agar tum unhein pao, namaz parho; na kaho [doosri riwayat mein: hargiz na kaho]: Main ne namaz parh li, main namaz nahin parhunga."
"738","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath sahaba ke giroh mein Ibn Shayyad ki taraf nikle, yahan tak ke unhon ne use Bani Maghalah ki imarat mein ladkon ke sath khelte paya; Ibn Shayyad us din baligh ke qareeb tha. Use khabar na hui yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se uski peeth mari, phir farmaya: ""Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Rasoolullah hun?!"" Us ne Aapko dekha aur kaha: ""Main gawahi deta hun ke tum ummiyon ke Rasool ho!"" Ibn Shayyad ne kaha: ""Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Rasoolullah hun?!"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use pakda phir farmaya: ""Main Allah aur uske Rasool par iman laya."" Phir Ibn Shayyad se kaha: ""Tum kya dekhte ho?"" Ibn as-Shayyad ne jawab diya: ""Mere paas sachcha aur jhoota aata hai."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum par muamla ghad-madh hua."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main ne tumhare liye kuchh chhupaya hai."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Woh Dukh hai."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Door ho, tum apni qadr se aage nahin badhe."" Umar ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya tum mujhe ijazat dete ho ke main uski gardan maarun?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar woh wahi hai, tum us par ghalib nahin hoge; aur agar woh wahi nahin hai, toh tumhare liye uske qatl mein khair nahin."
"739","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Uske baad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ubayy bin Kaab Ansari ke sath ek din khajoor ke pedon ki taraf gaye jahan Ibn Shayyad tha; jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue, Aap khajoor ke tanon se bachne lage, Ibn Shayyad se kuchh sunte hue is se pehle ke use dekhein; Ibn Shayyad apne bistar par leta tha apni chadar mein jis mein gunjunahat thi. Ibn Shayyad ki maa ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khajoor ke tanon se bachte dekha aur Ibn Shayyad se kaha: ""Ae Saaf! Aur woh uska naam hai yeh Muhammad hain."" Ibn Shayyad ghabra gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar woh use chhod deti, toh wazeh ho jata."
"740","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khade hue, Allah ki us se sana ki jo Uske layaq hai, phir Dajjal ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: ""Be-shak main tumhein us se dara raha hun; koi Nabi nahin magar us ne apni qaum ko daraya. Be-shak Nuh ne apni qaum ko daraya; lekin main tumhein uske bare mein woh kahunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum se nahin kaha: tum jaante ho ke woh kana hai, aur Allah kana nahin."
"741","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junubi hote, Aap apne sir par pani ke teen lap dalte."" Hasan bin Muhammad ne kaha: ""Main Allah ka banda hun! Mere baal us se zyada hain!"" Unhon ne kaha: Jabir ne apne hath se uski raan par mara aur kaha: ""Ae mere bhatije! Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke baal tumhare baalon se zyada aur khushbudar the."
"742","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madina mein ghode se khajoor ke tane par gire; Aapka paon utar gaya. Hum Aapki iyadat karte the Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ke kamre mein; hum Aapke paas aaye, jab Aap baithe hue namaz parh rahe the, hum ne khade hue namaz parhi. Phir hum Aapke paas doosri baar aaye jab Aap farz namaz baithe hue parh rahe the; hum ne Aapke peeche khade hue namaz parhi; Aap ne hamein ishara kiya ke baith jao. Jab namaz poori ki, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab imam baithe hue namaz parhe toh baithe hue namaz parho; jab khade hue namaz parhe toh khade hue namaz parho; khade na raho jabke imam baitha ho, jaise Faris apne badon ke sath karte hain."
"743","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Unhon [Jabir] ne kaha: Ansar mein se falan ka ladka paida hua, us ne use Muhammad nam diya; Ansar ne kaha: ""Hum tumhein Rasoolullah [ke naam] se nahin pukarte."" Yahan tak ke hum raaste mein baithe Aap se qiyamat ke bare mein poochte hue? Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mere paas qiyamat ke bare mein poochne aaye?"" Hum ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi zinda jaan nahin, us par sau saal aate hain."" Hum ne kaha: Ansar mein se falan ka ladka paida hua aur us ne use Muhammad nam diya; Ansar ne kaha: ""Hum tumhein Rasoolullah [ke naam] se nahin pukarte."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ansar ne achha kiya. Mere naam se naam rakho, meri kuniyat se kuniyat na rakho."
"744","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bazaar mein guzre oonchi jagah mein se dakhil hote hue jabke log Aapke ird-gird the; Aap kaate kaan wale [mare hue] bakri ke bachche par guzre; Aap ne use kaan se pakda, phir farmaya: ""Tum mein se kaun pasand karta hai ke yeh uska ho ek dirham mein?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Hum pasand nahin karte ke woh hamara ho kisi cheez mein; hum use kya karein?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum pasand karte ho ke woh tumhara ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" [Aap ne unhein teen baar kaha.] Unhon ne kaha: ""Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Agar woh zinda hota, us mein aib hota woh kaata kaan hai aur kaata kaan woh hai jiske kaan nahin hain phir woh mare hue kaise hoga?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ki qasam, duniya Allah ke paas is se zyada haqeer hai jitni woh tumhare paas hai."
"745","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Utay bin Dhamrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne walid ke paas ek shakhs ko dekha, jo jahiliyat ki asbiyat se pukarta tha, phir mere walid ne use adhdh ka hukm diya baghair kinaye ke uske sahaba ne use dekha. Unhon ne kaha: ""Goya tum ne use munkar samjha?!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main is mein kabhi kisi se nahin darta; be-shak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo jahiliyat ki asbiyat se pukare, use adhdh ka hukm do baghair kinaye ke."
"746","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke baghon mein se ek bagh mein the; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hath mein laathi thi jis se Aap pani aur mitti ke darmiyan marte the phir ek shakhs aaya ijazat mangne; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do."" Main gaya, toh Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) the, main ne unhein ijazat di, aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri di. Phir doosre shakhs ne ijazat mangi, Aap ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do."" Toh Umar (raziyallahu anhu) the, main ne unhein ijazat di, aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri di. Phir doosre shakhs ne ijazat mangi aur Aap tek lagaye hue the phir baithe aur farmaya: ""Use ijazat do aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do us aazmaish par jo use pahunchegi."" Main gaya, toh Usman the; main ne unhein ijazat di aur unhein woh bataya jo Aap ne kaha. Unhon ne kaha: ""Allah se madad mangi jati hai."
"747","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Salamah bin Wardan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik ko logon se musafaha karte dekha; unhon ne mujh se poocha: ""Tum kaun ho?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Bani Lais ka aazad-karda."" Unhon ne mere sir par teen baar hath phera, aur kaha: ""Allah tum mein barkat de."
"748","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ahl-e-Yaman aaye, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ahl-e-Yaman aa gaye, aur woh tum se narm dil hain."" Woh pehle the jo musafaha lekar aaye."
"749","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Tehiyyat ke tamam mein se hai ke tum apne bhai se musafaha karo."
"750","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke use hadees pahunchi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs se; us ne oont khareeda aur us par apna kajawa mahine bhar kasa, yahan tak ke Shaam pahuncha; toh Abdullah bin Unais the, main ne unhein bheja ke Jabir darwaze par hai, phir qasid wapas aaya aur bola: ""Jabir bin Abdullah?"" Main ne kaha: Haan, woh bahar nikle aur mujh se lipat gaye, main ne kaha: Hadees jo mujhe pahunchi main ne nahin suni; mujhe dar tha ke main mar jaun ya tum mar jao, Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah bandon ya logon ko nange ghair-makhtoon khaali jama karega,"" main ne kaha: Khaali kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Unke sath kuchh nahin hai, phir unhein aawaz dega jo door se sune mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: jaise use qareeb se sune: Main Badshah hun, jannat walon mein se kisi ke liye munasib nahin ke woh jannat mein dakhil ho, aur aag walon mein se koi use zulm se talash kare."" Aur aag walon mein se kisi ke liye munasib nahin ke woh aag mein dakhil ho, aur jannat walon mein se koi use zulm se talash kare."" Main ne kaha: Kaise? Hum Allah ke paas nange khaali aate hain? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nekiyon aur buraiyon se."
